This article lists the official '''squads for the 1995 Rugby World Cup''' in South Africa from 25 May to 24 June 1995. Players marked (c) were named as [[Captain (sports)|captain]] for their national squad. All details, such as number of international caps and player age, are current as of the opening day of the tournament on 25 May 1995.

